## [Feature] Network Request Interception: keep a request in-flight/pending
...
when intercepting network requests with https://playwright.dev/java/docs/network#handle-requests is there any way to keep a request in-flight/pending to test the “loading” state in the app?
...
> As in a real-life scenario, your app probably displays the "loading" state when it doesn't receive any answer for the request.
